From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Debayan Kar <kardebayan3@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 16:05:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/12] Replace MIUI SDK resources and widgets

Themes, styles and layouts reference resources of the MIUI SDK
package (com.miui.core, package ID 0x10) and inflate its widgets,
neither exists on AOSP. Without the parent themes the app theme
fails to resolve.

- Base the themes and widget styles on their DeviceDefault
  counterparts and set android:windowActionBar instead of the MIUI one
- Drop the MIUI only check widget attributes
- Inflate platform Switch, SeekBar and CheckedTextView widgets in
  place of the MIUI ones in the preference and spinner layouts
- Use the app's own back icon in the mimoji emoticon page
- Stop requiring framework package 16 to rebuild the APK
